The Cold Holding Excursion Diagnostics Domain Pack contains original shortened
summaries of public-domain FDA and DOE government information. Exact source
URLs, retrieval dates, and derived-content SHA-256 values are recorded in:

  domain-packs/cold-holding-excursion-diagnostics/1.0.0/LICENSES.yaml
  domain-packs/cold-holding-excursion-diagnostics/1.0.0/NOTICE.md

The fixed cold-storage validation excerpt under `fixtures/cold-holding` is a
small transformation of Zenodo record 15130001, licensed CC BY 4.0 and credited
in its local README. No FDA, DOE, EPA, or dataset-author endorsement is implied.

The standard Compose build compiles pgvector 0.8.6 from PostgreSQL-licensed
source and compiles a patched Ollama 0.33.1 binary from MIT-licensed source.
The exact upstream archives, checksums, and patched Go dependency versions are
pinned in infra/postgres/Dockerfile and infra/ollama/Dockerfile. These locally
built images are not endorsed by the upstream projects.
